<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?><ns2:section xmlns:ns2="http://rest.cis.illinois.edu" id="31675" href="schedule/2010/fall/DANC/101/31675.xml"><parents><calendarYear id="2010" href="schedule/2010.xml">2010</calendarYear><term id="120108" href="schedule/2010/fall.xml">Fall 2010</term><subject id="DANC" href="schedule/2010/fall/DANC.xml">Dance</subject><course id="101" href="schedule/2010/fall/DANC/101.xml">Modern Dance I</course></parents><sectionNumber>B  </sectionNumber><sectionTitle>Making Dances</sectionTitle><creditHours>1 hours</creditHours><statusCode>A</statusCode><sectionText>Making Dances is an introductory level choreography class for non-dance majors. This course is open to students in all disciplines; no dance experience is required. Each class session will comprise a 20-minute, basic movement warm-up followed by in-class explorations of choreographic processes. Topics will include: movement generation/development, rhythm, pacing, editing, structure, and form. Students will make dances in groups and individually.</sectionText><partOfTerm>1</partOfTerm><sectionStatusCode>A</sectionStatusCode><enrollmentStatus>UNKNOWN</enrollmentStatus><startDate>2010-08-23Z</startDate><endDate>2010-12-08Z</endDate><meetings><meeting id="0"><type code="LAB">Laboratory</type><start>01:00 PM</start><end>02:20 PM</end><daysOfTheWeek>TR     </daysOfTheWeek><roomNumber>2127</roomNumber><buildingName>Krannert Center for Perf Arts</buildingName><instructors><instructor lastName="Walter" firstName="R">Walter, R</instructor></instructors></meeting></meetings></ns2:section>